@startuml
[*] --> Login
Login --> ViewStock : After valid login
ViewStock --> ReceiveAlert : If stock is low
ViewStock --> SetReminder : If user sets reminder
ViewStock --> AnalyzeInventory : If user analyzes inventory
AnalyzeInventory --> GetRecommendation : Based on historical data
ReceiveAlert --> SetReminder : User sets reminder
SetReminder --> ViewStock : Reminder set
GetRecommendation --> ViewStock : Recommendations provided
ViewStock --> [*] : Logout or exit
@enduml
